From 6a40575cc0dc841a84f42367a45364ff7e626f09 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@local>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 13:28:30 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] fix(runtime): resolve accepted NAVIGATE detail into owned
 fullscreen

Resolve the canonical detail response through the existing shell detail controller without a timeline insertion or history close/reopen. Require explicit server acceptance, matching parent/route/tenant/principal/turn/profile and live integrity. Refuse late outcomes after close, Back, sign-out or another opener. Keep ordinary successor timeline behavior and the carrier visual implementation unchanged.

Add 33 NAVIGATE regression proofs including substituted results, authority refusals, zero timeline pollution, and focus return through Escape, Back and closeDetail. Based on combined candidate 1d519822bb92343f1bf4efdf92cbc4264eace48a; no backend files changed.
